{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50588","headline":"游石门洞（题拟） · 裴士淹","name":"游石门洞（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪竹乱花鸟，是月春将暮。\n登栈过崖畔，空间瞻瀑布。\n千龄无断绝，百尺恒奔注。\n高岩迸似珠，半壁洒如雾。\n澹艳水澄澈，欹倾石回护。\n药房森自闲，苔径窅谁遇。\n天翠落深沼，云华生轻树。\n班轮齐効功，严马何能喻？\n胜蹟盖爲寡，花钱游诚可屡。\n谢公镌旧词，安得寝章句？\n（见《永乐大典》卷一三○七四「一送」「洞」字「石门洞」条〖十四函一百三十四册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴士淹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}